{"h":[{"d":[{"f":"回去，離開，再出發。","e":["￹Mafelec `to~ `cangra~.￺￻他們回家了。"],"s":["`nokay~","`taloma'~"]},{"f":"結果，結局。","e":["￹`Ira~ `ko~ `nga'ayay~ `a~ `felec~ `nona~ `demak~.￺￻這件事有好的結果。"]},{"f":"經過。","e":["￹Mifelec `to~ `niyaro'~ `kami~.￺￻我們經過部落。"],"s":["`ta'elif~"]},{"f":"死亡。","e":["￹Mafelec`ay~ `ko~ fay`ina~y `nira~.￺￻她的先生過世了。"]}]}],"t":"felec"}